# Source is LF in the repository. Writing a file with CRLF on Windows turned a
# three-line edit into a 553-line diff, which makes review impossible and is how a
# mistake hides. Git normalizes on commit and leaves the working tree alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
